  "hero_html": "<div class=\"hero-grid\"><div class=\"hero-main\"><img class=\"hero-background\" src=\"../static/heroes/rice-grain-flour-noodles-cakes.webp\" alt=\"Rice grain, rice flour, rice noodles, puffed rice and rice cakes illustrating rice ingredient context.\" width=\"2164\" height=\"721\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><nav class=\"hero-crumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"https://heavymetalindex.com/\">Index</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><a href=\"https://heavymetalindex.com/ingredients/\">Ingredients</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span class=\"cur\">Rice</span><span class=\"hero-kind\">Ingredient</span></nav><div class=\"hero-titlerow\"><h1 class=\"hero-title\">Heavy metals in Rice</h1></div><p class=\"hero-dek\">A staple grain covered through evidence on arsenic and cadmium occurrence, growing conditions, processing and cooking. The page distinguishes grain measurements from cooked rice and finished products.</p><div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"hero-acts\"><a class=\"hero-act\" href=\"#cite-this-page\">Cite this page</a><a class=\"hero-act\" href=\"#update-history\">Version history</a></span></div></div><aside class=\"hero-sidebar\" aria-label=\"Page author and snapshot\"><div class=\"hero-author-panel\"><div class=\"author-hover\" data-author-card=\"true\"><a class=\"hero-author-portrait\" href=\"https://heavymetalindex.com/authors/karen-pendergrass\" aria-label=\"About Karen Pendergrass\" aria-describedby=\"author-card-summary\"><img src=\"../static/authors/karen-pendergrass-hmi-pink.webp\" alt=\"Karen Pendergrass\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\"></a><section class=\"author-card\" aria-label=\"About the author\"><div class=\"author-card-heading\"><img src=\"../static/authors/karen-pendergrass-hmi-pink.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><span class=\"author-card-eyebrow\">About the author</span><span class=\"author-card-name\"><a href=\"https://heavymetalindex.com/authors/karen-pendergrass\">Karen Pendergrass</a><a class=\"author-card-orcid\" href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2348-7259\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Karen Pendergrass ORCID profile\" title=\"View ORCID profile\"><svg class=\"orcid-id-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"128\" r=\"128\" fill=\"#A6CE39\"></circle><path fill=\"#fff\" d=\"M86.3 186.2H70.9V79.1h15.4v107.1zm22.6-107.1h41.6c39.6 0 57 28.3 57 53.6 0 27.5-21.5 53.6-56.8 53.6h-41.8V79.1zm15.4 93.3h24.5c34.9 0 42.9-26.5 42.9-39.7 0-21.5-13.7-39.7-43.7-39.7h-23.7v79.4z\"></path><circle cx=\"78.6\" cy=\"56.8\" r=\"10.1\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle></svg></a></span></div></div><p id=\"author-card-summary\">Standards architect and microbiome researcher connecting contaminant evidence, food exposure, and microbial metallomics.</p><p class=\"author-card-affiliations\">Institute of Contaminant Standards · Paleo Foundation · Microbiome Medicine · WikiBiome</p><a class=\"author-card-bio\" href=\"https://heavymetalindex.com/authors/karen-pendergrass\">View biography &amp; public works <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></section></div><p class=\"hero-author-label\">Author</p><div class=\"hero-author-name\"><a class=\"hero-author\" href=\"https://heavymetalindex.com/authors/karen-pendergrass\">Karen Pendergrass</a> <a class=\"hero-orcid\" href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2348-7259\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"ORCID iD 0000-0002-2348-7259\" title=\"ORCID iD 0000-0002-2348-7259\"><svg class=\"orcid-id-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"128\" r=\"128\" fill=\"#A6CE39\"></circle><path fill=\"#fff\" d=\"M86.3 186.2H70.9V79.1h15.4v107.1zm22.6-107.1h41.6c39.6 0 57 28.3 57 53.6 0 27.5-21.5 53.6-56.8 53.6h-41.8V79.1zm15.4 93.3h24.5c34.9 0 42.9-26.5 42.9-39.7 0-21.5-13.7-39.7-43.7-39.7h-23.7v79.4z\"></path><circle